    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R1 Color Harmony Pairing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">If a Top and Bottom of the same Outfit have colors that harmonize, infer pairsWellWith between them.</rdfs:comment>
